{"abstract":[{"text":"The client-supplied half of an OPAQUE enrolment, as it appears inside registration \/","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change-password \/ reset-completion \/ bootstrap request bodies. There is no standalone","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"register\/finish","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" endpoint, deliberately. A record can only be created at a moment when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"plaintext password legitimately exists on the client, and every one of those moments is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already an endpoint that takes a password. A free-standing finish would be an endpoint whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only job is to attach a credential to an account, which is a thing worth not having. Kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separate from ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CreateOpaqueCredential"},{"type":"text","text":"] because the tenant, the user and the credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier are all decided by the server — a client that could name them could enrol a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record against somebody else’s account."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/init(from:)","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/init(opaqueSession:registrationRecord:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/opaqueSession","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/registrationRecord"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/encode(to:)"],"